== diags.diag/string-concatenation
BYN2209 2:16 strings cannot be joined with `+`; use interpolation
  help write the parts as one interpolation: `$"{a}{b}"`, or `buf.append($"{a}{b}")` in a loop
  fix 2:16-2:32 $"Hello, {name}"
BYN2209 3:12 strings cannot be joined with `+`; use interpolation
  help write one literal: `"/usr/lib"`
  fix 3:12-3:27 "/usr/lib"
BYN2209 4:13 strings cannot be joined with `+`; use interpolation
  help write the parts as one interpolation: `$"{a}{b}"`, or `buf.append($"{a}{b}")` in a loop
  fix 4:13-4:30 $"{name}!{name}"
BYN2209 6:1 strings cannot be joined with `+`; use interpolation
  help write the parts as one interpolation: `s = $"{s}{x}"`, or build text in a `StrBuf`: `buf.append($"{a}{b}")`
  fix 6:1-6:12 log = $"{log}{name}"
